@@ -0,0 +1,14 @@
+#### Fix exitCode when parser can not infer (#17505 by @fisker)
+
+```console
+touch unknown
+prettier --check unknown > /dev/null;echo $?
+
+# Prettier stable
+[error] No parser could be inferred for file "</path/to/unknown>".
+0
+
+# Prettier main
+[error] No parser could be inferred for file "</path/to/unknown>".
+2
+```
