@@ -0,0 +1,13 @@
+# Plan
+
+## 1. Tests
+
+- [ ] 1.1 --check and --list-different on a file with no inferable parser exit with 2, with and without --write (tests/integration/__tests__/infer-parser.js) [AC-1]
+- [ ] 1.2 The --check summary reports the error instead of "All matched files use Prettier code style!" (tests/integration/__tests__/infer-parser.js) [AC-2]
+- [ ] 1.3 Unknown files found by expanding a directory stay silent and only the glob match fails the run (tests/integration/__tests__/patterns-dirs.js) [AC-3]
+
+## 2. Fix
+
+- [ ] 2.1 Make handleError return whether the error was skipped as unknown, and set exit code 2 for every undefined-parser error it reports (src/cli/format.js)
+- [ ] 2.2 Count the files that errored in formatFiles and print the error summary under --check (src/cli/format.js)
+- [ ] 2.3 Add the changelog entries (changelog_unreleased/cli/17505.md, changelog_unreleased/cli/17505-2.md)
